<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How DesignTested handles personal data and cookies.">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: 10 October 2026.</em></p>
  <p>This policy explains what data DesignTested collects when you visit the site and what we do with it. We follow the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Messages you send us.</strong> If you email us, we keep your message and address to reply to you.</li>
    <li><strong>Basic technical data.</strong> Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) processes IP addresses and request data to deliver the site and protect it from abuse.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics and advertising cookies.</strong> If we enable analytics or advertising, we will ask for your consent first and list the providers here.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>When you click an affiliate link, the vendor or affiliate network may set a cookie to credit us for the referral. This is governed by their privacy policy.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete your personal data, and you can complain to your national data protection authority (in Latvia: Datu valsts inspekcija).</p>
  <p>Contact: <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</Base>
